    <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Get the answer to a specific question in a workload review</h1>
    <small class="dont-index">Source: <a href="https://github.com/paws-r/paws/blob/HEAD/R/wellarchitected_operations.R" class="external-link"><code>R/wellarchitected_operations.R</code></a></small>
    <div class="hidden name"><code>wellarchitected_get_answer.Rd</code></div>
    </div>

    <div class="ref-description">
    <p>Get the answer to a specific question in a workload review.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="ref-usage">
    <div class="sourceCode"><pre class="sourceCode r"><code><span><span class="fu">wellarchitected_get_answer</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="va">WorkloadId</span>, <span class="va">LensAlias</span>, <span class="va">QuestionId</span>,</span>
<span>  <span class="va">MilestoneNumber</span><span class="op">)</span></span></code></pre></div>
    </div>

    <div id="arguments">
    <h2>Arguments</h2>
    <dl><dt>WorkloadId</dt>
<dd><p>[required]</p></dd>


<dt>LensAlias</dt>
<dd><p>[required]</p></dd>


<dt>QuestionId</dt>
<dd><p>[required]</p></dd>


<dt>MilestoneNumber</dt>
<dd></dd>

</dl></div>
    <div id="value">
    <h2>Value</h2>
    

<p>A list with the following syntax:</p>


